    <h1 id="welcome-to-markopress-test-site" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#welcome-to-markopress-test-site">#</a> Welcome to MarkoPress Test Site</h1>
<p>This is a test project using MarkoPress with a <strong>custom content directory</strong>.</p>
<h2 id="features" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#features">#</a> Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>Custom content location: <code>my-content/</code> instead of default <code>content/</code></li>
<li>Pages, docs, and blog all working from custom directories</li>
<li>Full markdown support with syntax highlighting</li>
<li>Theme customization options</li>
</ul>
